I mean everything in line of sight (tops of stacks only), dungeon walls 
on that level, stuff at the player's location, inventory, stats, spell 
lists, the \ known item type list.

Everything that could currently be made to appear on a UI without taking 
a (part of a) turn. This wouldn't include monsters who had wondered off, 
and wouldn't include information that could be gained from a /oProbing, 
stethoscope or Enlightenment. With more information, it would be too 
effective to cheat by modding the client.

